# Devastating Onslaught {X}{X}{R} with X=2 costs five mana (all five Moxen) and creates TWO tokens that are copies of
# Bot1's Llanowar Elves (X tokens, not one). The tokens gain haste until end of turn, so both attack the turn they are made
# (summoning sick otherwise, CR 302.6) together with the original that has been in play since turn 1: 3 x 1 = 3 damage
# (20 -> 17). They are sacrificed at the beginning of the next end step (CR 603.7c); the original stays.
# The Elves is cast on turn 1 with Mox Emerald; all five Moxen are untapped again on turn 3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Llanowar Elves
Devastating Onslaught
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
